<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Brickset</title><link>https://brickset.com</link><description>LEGO news from Brickset</description><copyright>Copyright (C) 1997-2026, Brickset ltd.</copyright><generator>Brickset RSS Generator</generator><item><title>My LEGO 'Fear'</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135830</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135830</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135830_Sticker Panel.jpg' alt="My LEGO 'Fear'"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Happy Hallowe&amp;#39;en!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are many things to fear in LEGO sets, from expensive prices and poor colour matching to &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/76274-1/Batman-with-the-Batmobile-vs-Harley-Quinn-and-Mr-Freeze"&gt;agonisingly descriptive set names&lt;/a&gt; and the recently-revealed &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/67012-1/The-Joker-Wall-Art-Comic-Cover"&gt;67012&lt;/a&gt; The Joker Wall Art Comic Cover.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, I encountered something else I really dislike while constructing &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/75645-1/Battle-at-Drum-Castle"&gt;75645&lt;/a&gt; Battle at Drum Castle yesterday: the dreaded &amp;#39;sticker applied on the inside of a wall panel&amp;#39;!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These are occasionally a necessary feature, where space is at an absolute premium, but I find them annoying for a number of reasons. Chief among them is that I think such details can be brick-built in the vast majority of cases and that is certainly the case with the shelves in Drum Castle. Also, they are tricky stickers to apply because it can be easy to trap dust or air bubbles underneath and you only have one chance to place them, as you cannot reach the corners to lift them for another attempt, trapped inside the panel as they are.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Even worse is the horrifying &amp;#39;sticker applied on the inside of a curved wall panel&amp;#39;, but those are fortunately quite rare nowadays. I still remember my apprehension placing a sticker on the inside of an &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/parts/design-48310"&gt;8x4x6 half cone element&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/76387-1/Hogwarts-Fluffy-Encounter"&gt;76387&lt;/a&gt; Hogwarts Fluffy Encounter!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Do you have any LEGO &amp;#39;fears&amp;#39; like mine? Let us know in the comments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vintage set of the week: 21 8-Stud Bricks</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135825</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135825</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/918-2.jpg' alt="Vintage set of the week: 21 8-Stud Bricks"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;This week's vintage set is &lt;a href='/sets/918-2'&gt;918&lt;/a&gt; 21 8-Stud Bricks, released during 1969. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-System/year-1969'&gt;31 System sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/918-2/rebrickable'&gt;21 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 38 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you might find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=918-2&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=918-2#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=918-2'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135825/vintage-set-of-the-week-21-8-stud-bricks"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: colmar04</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135824</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135824</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/colmar04.png' alt="Random figure of the day: colmar04"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/colmar04'&gt;colmar04&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Winter Soldier, Marvel Studios, Series 1&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Collectible-Minifigures'&gt;Collectible Minifigures&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/71031-4'&gt;71031-4&lt;/a&gt; Winter Soldier, released during 2021.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 25,466 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=colmar04&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=colmar04'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $9.00.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135824/random-figure-of-the-day-colmar04"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Ninth Panel: A new display case company launched this week</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135805</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135805</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135805_Ninth Panel Case Closed Lockup Colour Transparent.jpg' alt="Ninth Panel: A new display case company launched this week"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The LEGO display-case market has grown considerably in recent years, with collectors now able to choose from a wide range of attractive, set-specific displays. However, the experience surrounding those products has not always kept pace. Lengthy lead times, uncertain dispatch dates and slow customer service remain common frustrations.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Today, we are delighted to announce a new partnership with &lt;a href="https://NinthPanel.com"&gt;Ninth Panel&lt;/a&gt;, a founder-led company aiming to raise the standard in these areas, and a limited-time discount for Brickset on its first products.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The company launched earlier this week in the UK with its first two display cases available now and is preparing to begin domestic US fulfilment from its facility in Lakeland, Florida, on 16 November. Its approach combines thoughtful set-specific products with finished stock, prompt customer care and a closer relationship with the collectors buying them.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135805/ninth-panel-a-new-display-case-company-launched-this-week"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>How 11383 Mayor Manor looks with 10228 Haunted House</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135784</link><author>MeganL</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135784</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135784_IMG_9193.JPG' alt="How 11383 Mayor Manor looks with 10228 Haunted House"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;In my &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/134618"&gt;review&lt;/a&gt; of &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11383-1/Mayor-Manor"&gt;11383&lt;/a&gt; Mayor Manor, I mentioned that I was going to be rebuilding my copy of &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10228-1/Haunted-House"&gt;10228&lt;/a&gt; Haunted House to see what the start of a spooky neighbourhood would look like. 10228 is one of my favourite sets, so I need very little encouragement to put it together (again).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Some of you had mentioned it would be nice to see 11383 alongside &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/31167-1/Haunted-Mansion"&gt;31167&lt;/a&gt; Haunted Mansion. I agree! But I don&amp;#39;t have 31167 (because I have 10228!).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135784/how-11383-mayor-manor-looks-with-10228-haunted-house"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Blocks magazine issue 145 press release</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135798</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135798</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/blocks145-1.jpg' alt="Blocks magazine issue 145 press release"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here&amp;#39;s the press release for the latest issue of Blocks Managzine:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The latest issue of Blocks, the monthly magazine for LEGO fans, is packed with exclusive features and interviews &amp;ndash; the largest ever LEGO sets, amazing Christmas themed creations to get you ready for the holidays, inside the design of 67006 The Marvel Skyline, how a BrickLink Designer Program model goes from sketch to finished box, cyberpunk car builds and much, much more.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Issue 145 is available to order worldwide as part of a subscription or as a single issue at &lt;a href="http://blocksmag.com"&gt;blocksmag.com&lt;/a&gt; and will be in UK stores from November 6.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135798/blocks-magazine-issue-145-press-release"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:20:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: FIRE LORD</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135794</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135794</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/2235-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: FIRE LORD"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/2235-1'&gt;2235&lt;/a&gt; FIRE LORD, released during 2011. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-HERO-Factory/year-2011'&gt;27 HERO Factory sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/2235-1'&gt;125 pieces&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$19.99 / £17.99, which equates to about US$29 / £27 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 1,775 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=2235-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=2235-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $45.50,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=2235-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135794/random-set-of-the-day-fire-lord"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: frnd0662</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135793</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135793</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/frnd0662.png' alt="Random figure of the day: frnd0662"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/frnd0662'&gt;frnd0662&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Friends Zac - Blue Ski Suit / Jacket, Trousers, White Shoes&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Friends'&gt;Friends&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/41756-1'&gt;41756&lt;/a&gt; Holiday Ski Slope and Cafe, released during 2023.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 760 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=frnd0662&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=frnd0662'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $1.60.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135793/random-figure-of-the-day-frnd0662"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 42705 Cosy Autumn Forest Cabin</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135584</link><author>MeganL</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135584</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135584_IMG_9071.JPG' alt="Review: 42705 Cosy Autumn Forest Cabin"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Finishing up the larger Friends sets for the year is the other fall-themed set, &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/42705-1/Cosy-Fall-Forest-Cabin"&gt;42705&lt;/a&gt; Cosy Autumn Forest Cabin. For the first time, we have an autumn set featuring Autumn.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Coming in at over $100, I&amp;#39;m expecting one fancy cabin!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135584/review-42705-cosy-autumn-forest-cabin"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Mace Windu's Jedi Starfighter</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135766</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135766</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/7868-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Mace Windu's Jedi Starfighter"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/7868-1'&gt;7868&lt;/a&gt; Mace Windu's Jedi Starfighter, released during 2011. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Star-Wars/year-2011'&gt;32 Star Wars sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/7868-1'&gt;309 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-7868-1'&gt;5 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$39.99 / £35.99, which equates to about US$58 / £54 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 5,873 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=7868-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=7868-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $367.30,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=7868-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135766/random-set-of-the-day-mace-windu-s-jedi-starfighter"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: frnd0150</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135765</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135765</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/frnd0150.png' alt="Random figure of the day: frnd0150"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/frnd0150'&gt;frnd0150&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Friends Joy - Sand Green Cropped Trousers, Lavender and Dark Purple Vest Top over Bright Light Orange Shirt&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Friends'&gt;Friends&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/41122-1'&gt;41122&lt;/a&gt; Adventure Camp Tree House, released during 2016.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 2,483 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=frnd0150&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=frnd0150'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $2.10.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135765/random-figure-of-the-day-frnd0150"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Three 2027 LEGO Friends sets announced!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135733</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135733</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135733_42719_Prod_VeVVWJRsuub6.jpg' alt="Three 2027 LEGO Friends sets announced!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;LEGO Friends will turn fifteen in 2027 and three new sets from the theme have been announced today.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/42719-1/Heartlake-City-Shopping-Mall"&gt;42719&lt;/a&gt; Heartlake City Shopping Mall is perhaps the most interesting, as the fourth set with that name, while &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/42718-1/Friendship-Party-Bus"&gt;42718&lt;/a&gt; Friendship Party Bus includes a Daisy mini-doll, following the character&amp;#39;s debut in &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jk9Y2Z_QNmE"&gt;the live-action Friends musical&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View official images of the new sets, to be released on January 1st, below...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135733/three-2027-lego-friends-sets-announced!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO Marvel What If...? Sanctum Sanctorum revealed!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135732</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135732</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135732_67005_Prod_UoZHPeXWj3ju.jpg' alt="LEGO Marvel What If...? Sanctum Sanctorum revealed!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;A new Marvel set has been announced, adding to the &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/tag-Mini-Modular/theme-Marvel-Super-Heroes"&gt;Marvel modular street&lt;/a&gt; in 2027. &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/67005-1/Marvel-What-If--Doctor-Strange-Supreme"&gt;67005&lt;/a&gt; Marvel What If...? Doctor Strange Supreme features a new version of the Sanctum Sanctorum, under attack by zombies from the recent Marvel Zombies series!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The set contains 814 elements and it will cost &amp;pound;89.99, $99.99 or &amp;euro;99.99 when released on January 1st.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View more images after the break...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135732/lego-marvel-what-if--sanctum-sanctorum-revealed!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Build, Paint and Play GWP available now!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135741</link><author>Yellowcastle</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135741</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40889-1.jpg' alt="Build, Paint and Play GWP available now!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The highly anticipated &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40889-1"&gt;40889&lt;/a&gt; Build, Paint and Play is now available as a gift-with-purchase at LEGO.com starting today. It is free when you spend in excess of &amp;pound;115 / $130 / &amp;euro;130 until November 8th, or while stocks last.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Wait too long and it may be gone, gone, gone. We need to avoid that drama like LEGO and the Oxford comma. :o)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="/click"&gt;Shop now &amp;raquo;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:30:09 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: QUICK Good Guy Red</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135739</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135739</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/7719-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: QUICK Good Guy Red"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/7719-1'&gt;7719&lt;/a&gt; QUICK Good Guy Red, released during 2006. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Bionicle/year-2006'&gt;47 Bionicle sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/7719-1'&gt;21 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 157 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=7719-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=7719-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $21.20,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=7719-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135739/random-set-of-the-day-quick-good-guy-red"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: sw1282</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135738</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135738</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/sw1282.png' alt="Random figure of the day: sw1282"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/sw1282'&gt;sw1282&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Princess Leia - Celebration Outfit, Skirt&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Star-Wars'&gt;Star Wars&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/75365-1'&gt;75365&lt;/a&gt; Yavin 4 Rebel Base, released during 2023.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 6,236 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=sw1282&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=sw1282'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $13.60.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135738/random-figure-of-the-day-sw1282"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Quick look: 40898 Venetian Water Taxi</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135718</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135718</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135718_P1015420.jpg' alt="Quick look: 40898 Venetian Water Taxi"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Those who buy &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11388-1"&gt;11388&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Neighbourhood as soon at it&amp;#39;s released next week will receive &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40898-1"&gt;40898&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Water Taxi as a gift with purchase.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It works well as a stand-alone model and it can also be attached to the Venetian scene. Some may feel that the model is not complete without the GWP, but I&amp;#39;m not sure if that is necessarily the case.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135718/quick-look-40898-venetian-water-taxi"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Crystal Sweeper</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135712</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135712</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/8961-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Crystal Sweeper"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/8961-1'&gt;8961&lt;/a&gt; Crystal Sweeper, released during 2009. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Power-Miners/year-2009'&gt;18 Power Miners sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/8961-1'&gt;474 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-8961-1'&gt;4 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$69.99 / £41.09, which equates to about US$106 / £65 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 3,761 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=8961-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=8961-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $425.00,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=8961-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135712/random-set-of-the-day-crystal-sweeper"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: njo0173</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135710</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135710</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/njo0173.png' alt="Random figure of the day: njo0173"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/njo0173'&gt;njo0173&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Bow Master Soul Archer - Legs&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-NINJAGO'&gt;NINJAGO&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/70738-1'&gt;70738&lt;/a&gt; Final Flight of Destiny's Bounty, released during 2015.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 3,940 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=njo0173&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=njo0173'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $9.10.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135710/random-figure-of-the-day-njo0173"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>11388 Venetian Neighbourhood minifigures</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135699</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135699</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135699_P1015419.jpg' alt="11388 Venetian Neighbourhood minifigures"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11388-1"&gt;11388&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Neighbourhood includes a whopping 17 minifigures and while they are not the focus of the set, or a reason to consider buying it, they do enable you to &amp;#39;bring stories to life&amp;#39; according to LEGO, if that&amp;#39;s something you like to do with your sets.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The model itself leaves a lot to be desired, as you will have discovered if you read my &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135635/review-11388-venetian-neighbourhood"&gt;review&lt;/a&gt;, but that&amp;#39;s not the case for the minifigures: they are both plentiful and pleasing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135699/11388-venetian-neighbourhood-minifigures"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Hogwarts Castle</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135690</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135690</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/4709-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Hogwarts Castle"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/4709-1'&gt;4709&lt;/a&gt; Hogwarts Castle, released during 2001. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Harry-Potter/year-2001'&gt;11 Harry Potter sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/4709-1'&gt;682 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-4709-1'&gt;9 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$90 / £79.99, which equates to about US$160 / £146 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 6,163 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=4709-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=4709-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $378.00,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=4709-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135690/random-set-of-the-day-hogwarts-castle"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 03:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: sw0507</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135689</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135689</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/sw0507.png' alt="Random figure of the day: sw0507"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/sw0507'&gt;sw0507&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Endor Rebel Trooper - Sand Green&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Star-Wars'&gt;Star Wars&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/75023-1'&gt;75023&lt;/a&gt; LEGO Star Wars Advent Calendar, released during 2013.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 8,979 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=sw0507&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=sw0507'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $7.80.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135689/random-figure-of-the-day-sw0507"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Recent reviews</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135687</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135687</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;These are the reviews that we&amp;#39;ve published recently:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table class="reviewlist"&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td class="col1"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/11388-1.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;td&gt;
			&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135635"&gt;11388 Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
			A sizeable and detailed model but its overall appearance is let down by some questionable architectural choices&lt;/td&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td class="col1"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40889-1.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;td&gt;
			&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135605"&gt;40889 Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
			I am impressed with this set and its concept, but the teal astronaut could be better&lt;/td&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td class="col1"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40862-1.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;td&gt;
			&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135271"&gt;40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
			Four easy-to-build fun ornaments that would look good amongst the branches of your Christmas tree.&lt;/td&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td class="col1"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/30762-1.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;td&gt;
			&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135188"&gt;30762 Retro Video Game Batman&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
			The execution is fine, but this is a strange choice for a promotional Batman minifigure&lt;/td&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td class="col1"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/42690-1.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;td&gt;
			&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135416"&gt;42690 Forest Tea Party&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
			A charming autumn scene for a pocket money price&lt;/td&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
		&lt;tr&gt;
			&lt;td class="col1"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/40866-1.jpg" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;td&gt;
			&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135272"&gt;40866 Santa&amp;#39;s Holiday Sleigh Adventure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
			A bit overpriced, but a cute set, especially the reindeer!&lt;/td&gt;
		&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/news/category-Set-review"&gt;View more reviews in the news archive &amp;raquo;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135635</link><author>Huw</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135635</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135635_P1015340.jpg' alt="Review: 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/11388-1"&gt;11388&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Neighbourhood is this year&amp;#39;s &amp;#39;mega set&amp;#39; that&amp;#39;s being released in time for the holiday season.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#39;s stylistically similar to last year&amp;#39;s Ideas model &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/21359-1"&gt;21359&lt;/a&gt; Italian Riviera, but much larger. It&amp;#39;s also the second retail set to contain a 3D-printed element, a &amp;#39;functional&amp;#39; piano, the first being &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/10361-1/Holiday-Express-Train"&gt;last year&amp;#39;s Winter Village set&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The model is billed as being for &amp;#39;travel lovers&amp;#39; and is &amp;#39;inspired by the canals and architecture of the legendary city&amp;#39;. However, I suspect that anyone who&amp;#39;s actually been there would have had the same thought as me when I first saw it: &amp;#39;I don&amp;#39;t remember seeing a tower like that in Venice&amp;#39;...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135635/review-11388-venetian-neighbourhood"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>This week's top news articles</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135673</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135673</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="This week's top news articles"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the most read articles that we've posted during the last fortnight:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Article&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Date&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Likes&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Comments&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135438/lego-icons-11388-venetian-neighbourhood-revealed!'&gt;LEGO Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;15 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;13472&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;131&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;163&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135604/lego-ideas-40889-build-paint-and-play-revealed!'&gt;LEGO Ideas 40889 Build, Paint and Play revealed!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;23 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;8175&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;154&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;97&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135484/the-lego-parts-guide-understand-how-lego-really-works'&gt;The LEGO Parts Guide: understand how LEGO really works&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;17 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;7781&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;133&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;34&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135272/review-40866-santa-s-holiday-sleigh-adventure'&gt;Review: 40866 Santa's Holiday Sleigh Adventure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;20 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4944&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;97&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;49&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135603/lego-daft-punk-confirmed-for-2027!'&gt;LEGO DAFT PUNK confirmed for 2027!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;22 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;4633&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;91&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;82&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135605/review-40889-build-paint-and-play!'&gt;Review: 40889 Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;24 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3994&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;83&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;42&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/133773/review-72156-trainer-s-buggy-adventure-with-squirtle'&gt;Review: 72156 Trainer's Buggy Adventure with Squirtle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;13 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3704&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;56&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;36&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135188/review-30762-retro-video-game-batman'&gt;Review: 30762 Retro Video Game Batman&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;22 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3672&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;81&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;36&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135332/lego-ideas-hope-assembles-challenge-announced!'&gt;LEGO Ideas Hope Assembles challenge announced!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;11 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3621&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;53&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;74&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='https://brickset.com/article/135431/displaying-the-restaurant-collection'&gt;Displaying the restaurant collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;15 Oct&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;3616&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;132&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;28&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of news article views this week is 115,918, which is 3,676 more than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 10:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: The Farm</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135670</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135670</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/21114-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: The Farm"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/21114-1'&gt;21114&lt;/a&gt; The Farm, released during 2014. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Minecraft/year-2014'&gt;7 Minecraft sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/21114-1'&gt;262 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-21114-1'&gt;2 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;, and its retail price was US$29.99 / £24.99, which equates to about US$41 / £35 in today's money.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 6,510 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=21114-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=21114-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $56.70,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=21114-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135670/random-set-of-the-day-the-farm"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: trn150</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135669</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135669</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/trn150.png' alt="Random figure of the day: trn150"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/trn150'&gt;trn150&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Maersk Train Workman 2 - Silver Sunglasses&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Train'&gt;Train&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/10219-1'&gt;10219&lt;/a&gt; Maersk Train, released during 2011.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 8,046 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=trn150&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=trn150'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $7.50.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135669/random-figure-of-the-day-trn150"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:01:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>What's hot this week</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135667</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135667</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://brickset.com/assets/images/logo/logo.png' alt="What's hot this week"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;These are the sets that have been viewed the most this week:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class='neattable'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;TW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class='textcenter'&gt;LW&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Set&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Views&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;uarr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40909-1/Restaurants-of-the-World-Italy'&gt;40909&lt;/a&gt; Restaurants of the World: Italy&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;2147&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;uarr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/11388-1/Venetian-Neighbourhood'&gt;11388&lt;/a&gt; Venetian Neighbourhood&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1963&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75409-1/Jango-Fett-s-Starship'&gt;75409&lt;/a&gt; Jango Fett's Starship&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1863&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40889-1/Build-Paint-and-Play!'&gt;40889&lt;/a&gt; Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1811&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/853037-1/Star-Wars-Magnet-Set'&gt;853037&lt;/a&gt; Star Wars Magnet Set&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1782&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;uarr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75192-1/Millennium-Falcon'&gt;75192&lt;/a&gt; Millennium Falcon&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1649&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/75416-1/Chopper-(C1-10P)'&gt;75416&lt;/a&gt; Chopper (C1-10P)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1502&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/71018-13/Rocket-Boy'&gt;71018&lt;/a&gt; Rocket Boy&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1407&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&amp;darr;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/76294-1/X-Men-The-X-Mansion'&gt;76294&lt;/a&gt; X-Men: The X-Mansion&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1372&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class='textcenter'&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href='/sets/40874-1/Santa-s-Holiday-Countdown'&gt;40874&lt;/a&gt; Santa's Holiday Countdown&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;1249&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total number of set detail pages viewed this week is 1,762,479, which is 149,368 fewer than last week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 40889 Build, Paint and Play!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135605</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135605</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135605_Build 1.jpg' alt="Review: 40889 Build, Paint and Play!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://ideas.lego.com/challenges/1a8423a1-03cf-400c-ac20-54396477b267/entries/224c7e89-9113-498a-9ad9-e2f1fa392667"&gt;Build, Paint and Play!&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Doomslizer&lt;/em&gt; was picked as the winner of LEGO Ideas&amp;#39; &lt;a href="https://ideas.lego.com/challenges/1a8423a1-03cf-400c-ac20-54396477b267"&gt;Build Your Hobby&lt;/a&gt; challenge in September 2025. One year later, the revised model is about to be released and I think it looks superb, taking a fresh approach to model kit assembly!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Beyond a clever concept, &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40889-1/Build-Paint-and-Play!"&gt;40889&lt;/a&gt; Build, Paint and Play! includes a few elements of great interest to Classic Space fans. While the teal astronaut has appeared before, the light bluish grey helmet and air tanks are new, completing a minifigure began in 2017, so I expect this to be a popular gift-with-purchase.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135605/review-40889-build-paint-and-play!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Vintage set of the week: Santa and Sleigh</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135646</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135646</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/246-2.jpg' alt="Vintage set of the week: Santa and Sleigh"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;This week's vintage set is &lt;a href='/sets/246-2'&gt;246&lt;/a&gt; Santa and Sleigh, released during 1977. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Basic/year-1977'&gt;4 Basic sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/246-2/rebrickable'&gt;68 pieces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 114 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you might find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=246-2&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=246-2#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=246-2'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135646/vintage-set-of-the-week-santa-and-sleigh"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 02:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: sh0510</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135645</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135645</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/sh0510.png' alt="Random figure of the day: sh0510"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/sh0510'&gt;sh0510&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Iron Spider-Man - Mechanical Arms with Barbs&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Super-Heroes'&gt;Super Heroes&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/76108-1'&gt;76108&lt;/a&gt; Sanctum Sanctorum Showdown, released during 2018.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 12,441 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=sh0510&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=sh0510'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $33.10.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135645/random-figure-of-the-day-sh0510"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 01:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Quick look: 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135271</link><author>Benbacardi</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135271</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135271_40862-5_2255.jpg' alt="Quick look: 40862 Holiday Ornament Selection 2"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;The latest in the line of sets &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/tag-Tree-Ornament"&gt;designed to hang on your Christmas tree&lt;/a&gt; is &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40862-1"&gt;40862&lt;/a&gt; Holiday Ornament Selection 2, named presumably to follow on from &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40744-1"&gt;40744&lt;/a&gt; Christmas Ornament Selection two years ago. Four new round (but flat) ornaments join the line-up.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135271/quick-look-40862-holiday-ornament-selection-2"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO Ideas 40889 Build, Paint and Play revealed!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135604</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135604</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135604_40889_Prod_DAr7lzcWigRR.jpg' alt="LEGO Ideas 40889 Build, Paint and Play revealed!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/40889-1/Build-Paint-and-Play!"&gt;40889&lt;/a&gt; Build, Paint and Play! has been announced as the next LEGO Ideas gift-with-purchase and it will be available from October 28th.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Based on the winner of the &lt;a href="https://ideas.lego.com/challenges/1a8423a1-03cf-400c-ac20-54396477b267?tab=builds"&gt;Build Your Hobby&lt;/a&gt; challenge from last year, the set includes 158 pieces and it will be available with purchases of &amp;pound;115, $130 or &amp;euro;130 or more on LEGO.com.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;While the teal Classic Space astronaut is not unique, the light bluish grey air tanks and helmet included are needed to complete the astronaut started with the &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/71018-13/Rocket-Boy"&gt;Rocket Boy&lt;/a&gt; from 2017!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;View more images after the break...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135604/lego-ideas-40889-build-paint-and-play-revealed!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: Space minifigures</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135617</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135617</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/0012-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: Space minifigures"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/0012-1'&gt;0012&lt;/a&gt; Space minifigures, released during 1979. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Space/year-1979'&gt;22 Space sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/0012-1'&gt;12 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-0012-1'&gt;2 minifigs&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 142 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=0012-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=0012-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=0012-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135617/random-set-of-the-day-space-minifigures"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: sw0718</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135616</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135616</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/sw0718.png' alt="Random figure of the day: sw0718"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/sw0718'&gt;sw0718&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;General Leia&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-Star-Wars'&gt;Star Wars&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/75140-1'&gt;75140&lt;/a&gt; Resistance Troop Transporter, released during 2016.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 12,021 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=sw0718&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=sw0718'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $9.00.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135616/random-figure-of-the-day-sw0718"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LEGO DAFT PUNK confirmed for 2027!</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135603</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135603</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135603_DP1.jpg' alt="LEGO DAFT PUNK confirmed for 2027!"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Following a teaser yesterday, a partnership has today been announced between the LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK, to include an upcoming Ideas set! The press release follows:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builders After All: The LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK announce partnership &amp;ndash; blending worlds of music, culture and creative experimentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Today, the LEGO Group and DAFT PUNK are proud to announce a new partnership that aims to inspire and remix fandoms, with the Daft Punk robots entering the LEGO universe. Spanning product, content and brand experiences, the collaboration celebrates the creativity and communities that have shaped the legacy of both brands.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To introduce the partnership, the two brands have unveiled &lt;a href="https://www.lego.com/en-gb/categories/adults-welcome/article/daft-punk"&gt;a film on LEGO.com&lt;/a&gt; in which the duo&amp;rsquo;s minifigures follow a holographic red brick through what starts as a dark, mysterious landscape. As the robots arrive and step inside the &amp;ldquo;gates-of-play&amp;rdquo;, the holographic architecture starts to unfold and envelop them beat by beat, brick by brick, until we finally see the pair manning a LEGO brick-built console.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135603/lego-daft-punk-confirmed-for-2027!"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Review: 30762 Retro Video Game Batman</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135188</link><author>CapnRex101</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135188</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135188_Game 1.jpg' alt="Review: 30762 Retro Video Game Batman"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Batman has worn countless unique suits across his many appearances and despite the range of Batman minifigures available, lots of memorable bat-suits have not appeared in LEGO form. I am amazed the design from Sunsoft&amp;#39;s Batman: The Video Game was deemed a priority.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/30762-1/Retro-Video-Game-Batman"&gt;30762&lt;/a&gt; Retro Video Game Batman is definitely a departure from other versions of this character, however, given the vibrant lavender and purple colours. If nothing else, this is an interesting minifigure and one worthy of a closer look.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135188/review-30762-retro-video-game-batman"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random set of the day: The Crazy LEGO King</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135589</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135589</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/sets/small/2586-1.jpg' alt="Random set of the day: The Crazy LEGO King"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random set is &lt;a href='/sets/2586-1'&gt;2586&lt;/a&gt; The Crazy LEGO King, released during 1998. It's one of &lt;a href='/sets/theme-Castle/year-1998'&gt;20 Castle sets&lt;/a&gt; produced that year. It contains &lt;a href='/inventories/2586-1'&gt;26 pieces&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href='/minifigs/in-2586-1'&gt;1 minifig&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's owned by 888 Brickset members. If you want to add it to your collection you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=2586-1&amp;jump=1&amp;cat=3&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?S=2586-1#T=S'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $50.00,  or &lt;a href='/buy/ebay/?query=2586-1'&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135589/random-set-of-the-day-the-crazy-lego-king"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 02:01:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Random figure of the day: loc138</title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135588</link><author>Huwbot</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135588</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://img.bricklink.com/ItemImage/MN/0/loc138.png' alt="Random figure of the day: loc138"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's random figure is &lt;a href='/minifigs/loc138'&gt;loc138&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Eris - Armor Breastplate, Flame Wings&lt;/em&gt;, a &lt;a href='/minifigs/category-LEGENDS-OF-CHIMA'&gt;LEGENDS OF CHIMA&lt;/a&gt; figure that came in one set, &lt;a href='/sets/70224-1'&gt;70224&lt;/a&gt; Tiger's Mobile Command, released during 2015.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our members collectively own a total of 1,389 of them. If you'd like to buy one you should find it for sale at &lt;a href='https://www.brickowl.com/search/catalog?query=loc138&amp;jump=1&amp;&amp;utm_source=brickset'&gt;Brick Owl&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href='https://www.bricklink.com/v2/search.page?q=loc138'&gt;BrickLink&lt;/a&gt;, where new ones sell for around $10.30.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135588/random-figure-of-the-day-loc138"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:01:03 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Quick look: 42690 Forest Tea Party </title><link>https://brickset.com/article/135416</link><author>MeganL</author><guid>https://brickset.com/article/135416</guid><description>&lt;img style='float:left; margin: 0 10px 10px 0; max-width: 240px; max-height: 240px;' src='https://images.brickset.com/news/thumbs/large/135416_IMG_8949.JPG' alt="Quick look: 42690 Forest Tea Party "/&gt;&lt;p&gt;There are a few autumn/forest themed sets in the second wave of Friends this year, with the smallest set being &lt;a href="https://brickset.com/sets/42690-1/Forest-Tea-Party"&gt;42690&lt;/a&gt; Forest Tea Party. I love a good tea party, and I&amp;#39;m wiling to bet that the Friends do too.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://brickset.com/article/135416/quick-look-42690-forest-tea-party"&gt;Continue reading »&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 &lt;a href='https://brickset.com/'&gt;Brickset.com&lt;/a&gt;. Republication prohibited without prior permission.&lt;em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>